codex-messenger upstream attribution
=====================================

This project (claude-messenger) is an independent reimplementation of
codex-messenger (https://github.com/anisayari/codex-messenger), authored
by Anis AYARI and released under the MIT License.

The following assets and source files in this repository are reused from
the upstream codex-messenger source tree under the terms of its MIT
license (see ./LICENSE in this directory):

  public/audio/                   MSN Messenger 7 sound pack
  public/icons/                   Application and contact icons
  public/msn-assets/              MSN 7.5.0322 extracted assets,
                                  emoticons, winks, dynamic backgrounds,
                                  and integrity manifests
  public/screenshots/             Demo screenshots (interface previews)

  src/chatParts.jsx               MSN-style chat surface components
  src/chatTextStyle.js            Text styling helpers
  src/composer.jsx                Message composer
  src/gamesPanel.jsx              Embedded games panel
  src/i18n.js                     UI translations (FR/EN/ES/JP)
  src/main.jsx                    Renderer entry point
  src/mediaPanels.jsx             Media side panels (camera, voice, etc.)
  src/messageFormatting.jsx       Message rendering and formatting
  src/msnDisplayPictures.js       Generated avatars
  src/msnEmoticons.js             MSN emoticon strip rendering
  src/rosterUtils.js              Contact list grouping and ordering
  src/rosterView.jsx              Roster (contact list) component
  src/soundEffects.js             Sound playback helpers
  src/styles.css                  Windows XP / MSN 7 stylesheet
  src/threadTabs.jsx              MSN-style thread tabs
  src/updateDialog.jsx            Update dialog
  src/usePromptDialog.jsx         Prompt dialog hook
  src/useUnreadState.js           Unread tracking
  src/useUpdates.js               Update checker hook
  src/versionLabel.js             Version label utilities
  src/windowChrome.jsx            XP window chrome
  src/winks.js                    Wink (animated GIF) helpers

  shared/languages.js             Language definitions for i18n
  shared/threadSelection.js       Thread selection helpers (pure logic)
  shared/versionUtils.js          Version comparison utilities

  index.html                      Vite renderer entry HTML
  vite.config.js                  Vite configuration

Some of these files contain references to "Codex" or upstream-specific
behavior; they are progressively adapted to Claude in subsequent commits.
